			<a class="post-thumbnail" href="https://techblog.site.je/2026/08/01/%e0%a6%b8%e0%a6%b9%e0%a6%9c%e0%a7%87%e0%a6%87-%e0%a6%b2%e0%a6%be%e0%a6%b0%e0%a6%be%e0%a6%ad%e0%a7%87%e0%a6%b2-laravel-%e0%a6%b6%e0%a6%bf%e0%a6%96%e0%a7%87-%e0%a6%95%e0%a7%8d%e0%a6%af%e0%a6%be/" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">
				<img width="1376" height="768" src="https://techblog.site.je/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Gemini_Generated_Image_laldldlaldldlald.png" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="সহজেই লারাভেল (Laravel) শিখে ক্যারিয়ার গড়ুন: জিরো থেকে প্রফেশনাল ডেভেলপার হওয়ার গাইডলাইন" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://techblog.site.je/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Gemini_Generated_Image_laldldlaldldlald.png 1376w, https://techblog.site.je/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Gemini_Generated_Image_laldldlaldldlald-300x167.png 300w, https://techblog.site.je/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Gemini_Generated_Image_laldldlaldldlald-1024x572.png 1024w, https://techblog.site.je/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Gemini_Generated_Image_laldldlaldldlald-768x429.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1376px) 100vw, 1376px" />			</a>

